WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.563
Tell us about Singin' In The Bathtub.

00:00:03.585 --> 00:00:05.830
These are performances that
are meant for children,

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:06.663
is that right?

00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:09.760
Well yes, Sony Wonder
Music they came to me.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.760
Their whole this is great music for kids

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.196
that parents can actually
endure, if not enjoy.

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:20.100
And actually this is a fantastic album.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.920
We put together a whole bunch of songs,

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.280
almost all of them from
40 and 50 years ago,

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.000
great old novelty songs,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.360
kinda thing Danny Kaye and
Cab Calloway used to sing.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.360
Gave them these fabulous
swing arrangements.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.700
Great music producer Jai
Winding did it with me

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.830
and voila, I'm a recording artist.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.430
Now what we wanted to
do tonight obviously,

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:41.840
was have you sing one of these songs

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.400
for a group of children.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.550
We couldn't get a group of children

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:48.190
so John is now gonna sing these songs.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.336
We have some crew members here.

00:00:50.336 --> 00:00:51.870
(audience laughing)

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.810
These guys are all union and
you can do this for them?

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:54.643
I'm delighted.

00:00:54.643 --> 00:00:55.512
All right let's see this.

00:00:55.512 --> 00:00:56.345
I wanna see this right now.

00:00:56.345 --> 00:00:59.345
(audience cheering)

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.900
I will entertain children of all ages.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.859
Hi kids.

00:01:08.859 --> 00:01:09.692
(audience members) Hi.

00:01:09.692 --> 00:01:10.916
I said, hi kids.

00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:11.830
(audience members) Hi.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:12.874
That's better.

